# Jetmir's Garden is a Mountain Forest Plains: Arena of Glory ("enters tapped unless you control a Mountain") comes in untapped on
# turn 3 beside it, and Bleachbone Verge's "{T}: Add {W}. Activate only if you control a Plains or a Swamp" is offered on turn 5.
# On turn 1 the Garden itself entered tapped.

[Bot1 Deck]
Jetmir's Garden
Arena of Glory
Bleachbone Verge
Island x4
Island x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Jetmir's Garden.Play
? Bot1.Battlefield.Jetmir's Garden.Tapped = true
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Arena of Glory.Play
? Bot1.Battlefield.Arena of Glory.Tapped = false
[T5 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Bleachbone Verge.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Bleachbone Verge.Activate(Ability: {W})
? Bot1.Mana = {W}

[Expect]
Turn = 5
Bot1.Mana = {W}
